# Meltwater

> Meltwater is a unified intelligence platform for PR, communications, and marketing teams. It brings together media, social, influencer, and AI-search signals — combining AI analysis with human expertise — so organizations can see the full picture, understand what it means, and act with confidence.

Meltwater serves more than 27,000 organizations across 130+ countries. The links below provide the primary English-language sources for understanding the company, platform, products, capabilities, and common use cases.

