## Media intelligence and PR

- [Media Monitoring](https://www.meltwater.com/en/products/media-monitoring): Real-time monitoring and analysis across online news, print, broadcast, podcasts, social media, and other sources.
- [Media Intelligence](https://www.meltwater.com/en/capabilities/media-intelligence): Connected monitoring, analysis, and reporting for PR and communications teams.
- [Media Relations](https://www.meltwater.com/en/capabilities/media-relations): Journalist discovery, media-list management, pitching, outreach, and relationship workflows.
- [Media Database](https://www.meltwater.com/en/products/media-database): Searchable journalist and media-contact data for targeted PR outreach.
- [Press Release Distribution](https://www.meltwater.com/en/products/press-distribution): Press-release distribution with targeting, reporting, and monitoring workflows.
- [PR Reporting](https://www.meltwater.com/en/products/pr-reporting): Real-time PR analytics and reporting for measuring coverage, reputation, campaigns, and competitive performance.
- [Custom Reports](https://www.meltwater.com/en/products/custom-reports): Bespoke, analyst-supported reporting designed for executives and other stakeholders.
- [Real-Time Alerting](https://www.meltwater.com/en/products/real-time-alerting): Automated alerts for important mentions, unusual activity, emerging issues, and narrative changes.
- [Newsletters and Newsfeeds](https://www.meltwater.com/en/products/newsletters): Tools for curating monitored coverage into branded newsletters, briefings, and website newsfeeds.

